                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-sky-100 text-sky-600 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl group-hover:scale-110 transition">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-list-check"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-4">Kuis Evaluasi</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mt-2">Uji pemahamanmu dengan 10 soal kuis pilihan ganda yang dilengkapi pembahasan komprehensif.</p>
                    <div class="mt-4 text-sky-600 font-semibold text-sm flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition">
                        Mulai Kuis <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Card 3 -->
                <div onclick="switchTab('dragdrop')" class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-xl transition duration-300 cursor-pointer border-t-4 border-amber-500 group">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl group-hover:scale-110 transition">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-hand-pointer"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-4">Game Drag & Drop</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mt-2">Seru! Kelompokkan berbagai contoh kemasan dan nama obat ke dalam wadah golongan yang tepat.</p>
                    <div class="mt-4 text-amber-600 font-semibold text-sm flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition">
                        Mainkan Game <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Pharmacy Fact Ticker -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-4 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 flex items-center gap-4">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-rose-100 text-rose-700 font-bold text-xs rounded-lg whitespace-nowrap">Tahukah Kamu?</span>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 truncate">Obat Bebas Terbatas selalu dilengkapi dengan tanda peringatan khusus berwarna hitam (P.No. 1 sampai P.No. 6)!</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- TAB 2: TUJUAN PEMBELAJARAN -->
        <section id="content-tujuan" class="tab-content hidden fade-in space-y-6">
            <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-lg border border-emerald-100">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-slate-200 pb-4 mb-6">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800">Capaian & Tujuan Pembelajaran</h2>
                        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500">Kurikulum Merdeka - Fase E (Kelas X SMK Farmasi)</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                    <!-- Capaian Pembelajaran (CP) -->
                    <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-3">
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 font-bold text-xs rounded-lg">Capaian Pembelajaran (CP)</span>
                        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">Dasar-Dasar Kefarmasian</h3>
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
