                    <button onclick="filterMateri('peringatan')" class="materi-filter-btn bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-200 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold">Tanda Peringatan</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Grid Kartu Materi -->
            <div id="materi-grid" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">

                <!-- KARTU 1: OBAT BEBAS -->
                <div class="materi-card kimia glass-card rounded-2xl p-5 hover:shadow-xl transition border-2 border-emerald-400 relative">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 text-xs font-bold rounded-full">Obat Kimia</span>
                        <!-- Logo Visual -->
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 border-2 border-black flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow">
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold">BEBAS</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-3">1. Obat Bebas</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                        Obat yang dapat dijual bebas kepada umum tanpa resep dokter di apotek maupun toko obat berizin.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-4 p-3 bg-emerald-50/80 rounded-xl space-y-1 border border-emerald-100 text-xs">
                        <p class="font-semibold text-emerald-900"><strong>Ciri Logo:</strong> Lingkaran hijau dengan garis tepi hitam tebal.</p>
                        <p class="text-slate-600"><strong>Contoh:</strong> Parasetamol, Antasida Doen, Vitamin C.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- KARTU 2: OBAT BEBAS TERBATAS -->
                <div class="materi-card kimia glass-card rounded-2xl p-5 hover:shadow-xl transition border-2 border-sky-400 relative">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 text-xs font-bold rounded-full">Obat Kimia</span>
                        <!-- Logo Visual -->
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-sky-500 border-2 border-black flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow">
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold">W-OBT</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mt-3">2. Obat Bebas Terbatas</h3>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 text-xs mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                        Obat keras yang dapat dibeli tanpa resep dokter tetapi disertai tanda peringatan P.No 1 s/d P.No 6.
